    <description>This flow is basically the same as the &quot;Contact Contact Relationship - After Save - Create/Sync Inverse Relationship&quot;. Any logic changes here likely should be made in that flow as well.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description>NOTE: this basically checks if any of the values being set in the &quot;Update inverse record&quot; node are different between the two records. One callout: mostly checks to see if the values are the same, but the PartyRoleRelation field shouldn&apos;t be the exact same - the records should have the inverse role of each other.</description>
        <name>f_InverseRecHadDiffValues</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>OR(
   {!$Record.StartDate} != {!$Record.RelatedInverseRecord.StartDate},
   {!$Record.EndDate} != {!$Record.RelatedInverseRecord.EndDate},
   {!$Record.IsActive} != {!$Record.RelatedInverseRecord.IsActive},
   TEXT({!$Record.HierarchyType}) != TEXT({!$Record.RelatedInverseRecord.HierarchyType}),
   {!$Record.PartyRoleRelation.RelatedInverseRecordId} != {!$Record.RelatedInverseRecord.PartyRoleRelationId}
)</expression>
    </formulas>
